                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 825.001.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Chargé Pierrepont to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1910-09-06"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">September 6,
                    1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Pierrepont states that after a short illness the Vice President of the
                    Republic of Chile, Señor Fernandez Albano, died this day.</p>
            </div>
